@startuml
title Activity Diagram: Document Processing

start
:Watcher detects new file in 'Inbox';
:Read file metadata (creation date, etc.);

if (File meets sorting rules?) then (yes)
  :Move file to dated folder;
  :Update file path variable;
else (no)
endif

:Extract text content from file;
:Send text to Ollama for analysis;
:Receive Summary, Keywords, Tags, Embedding;
:Store all context and file path in ContextDB;
:Push WebSocket update to notify UI;

stop
@enduml